{"suttaId":"tha-ap539","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[4535,4624],"vripara":"221"},"segments":{"tha-ap539:0.3":"Mahākoṭṭhikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap539:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbalokavidū muni;","tha-ap539:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji cakkhumā.","tha-ap539:2.1":"“Ovādako viññāpako, tārako sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap539:2.3":"Desanākusalo buddho, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap539:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, hitesī sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap539:3.3":"Sampatte titthiye sabbe, pañcasīle patiṭṭhapi.","tha-ap539:4.1":"“Evaṃ nirākulaṃ āsi, suññataṃ titthiyehi ca;","tha-ap539:4.3":"Vicittaṃ arahantehi, vasībhūtehi tādibhi.","tha-ap539:5.1":"“Ratanānaṭṭhapaññāsaṃ, uggato so mahāmuni;","tha-ap539:5.3":"Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāso, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo.","tha-ap539:6.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap539:6.3":"Tāvatā tiṭṭhamāno so, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap539:7.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, brāhmaṇo vedapāragū;","tha-ap539:7.3":"Upecca sabbalokaggaṃ [sabbasāraggaṃ (sī.), sattapāragaṃ (pī.)], assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ.","tha-ap539:8.1":"“Tadā so sāvakaṃ vīro, pabhinnamatigocaraṃ;","tha-ap539:8.3":"Atthe dhamme nirutte ca, paṭibhāne ca kovidaṃ.","tha-ap539:9.1":"“Ṭhapesi etadaggamhi, taṃ sutvā mudito ahaṃ;","tha-ap539:9.3":"Sasāvakaṃ jinavaraṃ, sattāhaṃ bhojayiṃ tadā.","tha-ap539:10.1":"“Dussehacchādayitvāna, sasissaṃ buddhisāgaraṃ [buddhasāgaraṃ (ka.)];","tha-ap539:10.3":"Nipacca pādamūlamhi, taṃ ṭhānaṃ patthayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap539:11.1":"“Tato avoca lokaggo,‘passathetaṃ dijuttamaṃ;","tha-ap539:11.3":"Vinataṃ pādamūle me, kamalodarasappabhaṃ.","tha-ap539:12.1":"“‘Buddhaseṭṭhassa [seṭṭhaṃ buddhassa (syā. ka.)] bhikkhussa, ṭhānaṃ patthayate ayaṃ;","tha-ap539:12.3":"Tāya saddhāya cāgena, saddhammassavanena [tena dhammassavena (sī. pī. ka.)] ca.","tha-ap539:13.1":"“‘Sabbattha sukhito hutvā, saṃsaritvā bhavābhave;","tha-ap539:13.3":"Anāgatamhi addhāne, lacchase taṃ manorathaṃ.","tha-ap539:14.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap539:14.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap539:15.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap539:15.3":"Koṭṭhiko nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako’.","tha-ap539:16.1":"“Taṃ sutvā mudito hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","tha-ap539:16.3":"Mettacitto paricariṃ, sato paññāsamāhito.","tha-ap539:17.1":"“Tena kammavipākena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap539:17.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap539:18.1":"“Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap539:18.3":"Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap539:19.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap539:19.3":"Sabbattha sukhito āsiṃ, tassa kammassa vāhasā.","tha-ap539:20.1":"“Duve bhave saṃsarāmi, devatte atha mānuse;","tha-ap539:20.3":"Aññaṃ gatiṃ na gacchāmi, suciṇṇassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap539:21.1":"“Duve kule pajāyāmi, khattiye atha brāhmaṇe;","tha-ap539:21.3":"“Nīce kule na jāyāmi, suciṇṇassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap539:22.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, brahmabandhu ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap539:22.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ vippakule, paccājāto mahaddhane.","tha-ap539:23.1":"“Mātā candavatī nāma, pitā me assalāyano;","tha-ap539:23.3":"Yadā me pitaraṃ buddho, vinayī sabbasuddhiyā.","tha-ap539:24.1":"“Tadā pasanno sugate, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap539:24.3":"Moggallāno ācariyo, upajjhā sārisambhavo.","tha-ap539:25.1":"“Kesesu chijjamānesu, diṭṭhi chinnā samūlikā;","tha-ap539:25.3":"Nivāsento ca kāsāvaṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap539:26.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne ca me mati;","tha-ap539:26.3":"Pabhinnā tena lokaggo, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap539:27.1":"“Asandiṭṭhaṃ viyākāsiṃ, upatissena pucchito;","tha-ap539:27.3":"Paṭisambhidāsu tenāhaṃ, aggo sambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap539:28.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap539:29.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap539:30.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap539:31.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mahākoṭṭhiko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap539:32.1":"Mahākoṭṭhikattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3486,"to":3486,"paras":[{"para":3486,"vripara":"221","refs":["tha-ap539:1"],"words":["padumuttaro nāma jino"],"lines":["So aparena samayena vimuttisukhaṃ paṭisaṃvedento somanassajāto attano pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthameva."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap539:1"],["tha-ap539:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
